# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WhatsApp browser session profiles — NEVER COMMIT
# These are Chromium user_data dirs containing live session cookies,
# "Login Data" (saved passwords), Local Storage and encrypted keys.
# Exfiltrating them grants full account takeover. Regenerate by re-scanning
# the QR code; they are runtime state, not source.
/whatsapp_sessions/
/whatsapp_session/
*.session/
/sessions/
/user_data/
/user-data/
/browser_data/
/browser-data/
/chrome-profile/
*Cookies
*Login Data
*Local State
*Local Storage

